  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Discover (ADR-0016)",
      "items": [
        "The edge reads; the source systems are never written to. Odoo: authenticate, search_read, fields_get, search_count. Shopify: GraphQL queries only.",
        "The secret stays in the edge's own store, never in the work directory or the cloud.",
        "ovs-dlab5-edge: ovs_dlab5_edge/discovery.py, connectors/"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Derive (ADR-0018)",
      "items": [
        "As-is: which Odoo capabilities realise each B2C step, with evidence: records counted, or only a module installed.",
        "Availability: what the Shopify store has (included, installed) or can get (licensable). Available is not used.",
        "Both from runs already on this PC; nothing is read again. realise.py, availability.py"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Model, then Map",
      "items": [
        "A step both sides could do is an overlap: allocating it is a decision with a reason, recorded as the workspace's Decision row before the allocation is written. allocate.py",
        "The Map gate opens when every top-level step is allocated: shapes/ovs-map-ready.ttl in ovs-dlab5-net.",
        "Map, field to field, is the next step: it is not built yet."
      ]
    }
  ]
